From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 09:58:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: accept visitor identity in POST body on all proxies

Add a shared POST JSON contract in context-engine so Akamai, Cloudflare,
and Next.js can take quirks, device, scores, tests, enrichments, and
events from the client instead of CDP or cookie injection. Uniform
composition fetch stays a cacheable GET.
